{"id":"n41603-1-17","stage":3,"title":"눈썹 · 眉毛","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41603-1-17-1","ko":"앞머리를 어떻게 잘라 드릴까요?","zh":"要怎么剪刘海比较好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앞머리를","meaning":"刘海","explanation":"앞머리：刘海；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"앞머리","audio":"/audio/3f2826edc67237471a97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66879","senseId":"2","lemma":"앞머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞머리를","audio":"/audio/7a3cffb3491d1284a710.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"잘라","meaning":"剪掉，切掉","explanation":"자르다：剪掉，切掉；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"자르다","audio":"/audio/1d818f15fdfd54e51260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17787","senseId":"4","lemma":"자르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘라","audio":"/audio/f215e75313727961651d.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴까요?","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴까요","audio":"/audio/235c96fe68d709255264.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3f2826edc6723747","term":"앞머리","zh":"刘海","audio":"/audio/3f2826edc67237471a97.mp3","entryId":"66879","definition":"头前部留的头发。","pronunciation":["암머리"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"1d818f15fdfd54e5","term":"자르다","zh":"剪掉，切掉","audio":"/audio/1d818f15fdfd54e51260.mp3","entryId":"17787","definition":"从整体中将一部分拿掉。","pronunciation":["자르다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c9e86d6f61ed270346d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41603-1-17-2","ko":"앞머리가 여기 눈 위의 눈썹까지 내려오도록 잘라 주세요.","zh":"请把刘海剪到这里，刚好盖在眉毛的位置。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앞머리가","meaning":"刘海","explanation":"앞머리：刘海；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"앞머리","audio":"/audio/3f2826edc67237471a97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66879","senseId":"2","lemma":"앞머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞머리가","audio":"/audio/638d4ebe89dfb67cccdb.mp3"}},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"눈","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}},{"text":"위의","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"1","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위의","audio":"/audio/7b58a277dee1b91965c4.mp3"}},{"text":"눈썹까지","meaning":"眉毛","explanation":"눈썹：眉毛；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"눈썹","audio":"/audio/991e6f629e313d4ac4d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41603","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈썹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈썹까지","audio":"/audio/7817357362daf183a7d9.mp3"}},{"text":"내려오도록",